 ],
 "notes": "Suite-validated on 2026-11-05: the OID4VP wallet plan iso_mdl variant (oid4vp-1final-wallet-test-plan, x509_san_dns / direct_post / request_uri_signed / plain_vp) passed against the engine through the mini-wallet (plan OzBNWDaDeiAn7, suite 5.3.4; the evidence is archived under results/mini-wallet-vp-mdoc/2026-11-05 in siros-conformance). The host mdoc presentation is the wasm mini host siros-mdoc DeviceResponse; the vp_token here is the token the scripted host answers with, structured by the engine as the \u00a78.1 object."
